'''Ice Blocks''' are a common [[block]] type found alongside [[Snow Block]]s in the [[Snow biome|Snow]] and [[Ice biome]]s. They can be mined with a [[pickaxe]] or [[drill]]. Ice Blocks have low friction, causing a player walking over them to slide when stopping or changing directions. This effect can be mitigated by equipping [[Ice Skates]] or other [[accessories]] crafted from them.

Ice Blocks can be converted into three other variants via the [[Biome spread|spread of biomes]]:
* [[Corruption]] spreads onto Ice to create '''Purple Ice Blocks'''
* [[Crimson]] spreads onto Ice to create '''Red Ice Blocks'''
* [[Hallow]] spreads onto Ice to create '''Pink Ice Blocks'''
These will also spread their respective biomes.

