The '''Life Fruit''' is a [[Hardmode]] [[plant]] and [[permanent booster]] item that grows on [[Jungle grass]] in any area within the [[Underground]] [[layer]] or below, and only after any [[mechanical boss]] has been defeated. Life Fruit grow 25% faster on average in [[Expert Mode]].{{source code ref|v=1.4.2.3|name=grassgrowth|method=Terraria.WorldGen.UpdateWorld_GrassGrowth}}

When used, a Life Fruit permanently increases the player's [[health]] capacity by 5 and restores the player's health by 5, turning one unit in the player's [[health bar]] golden. Life Fruit can only be used once a player has reached the 400 health cap from consuming [[Life Crystal]]s. A total of 20 Life Fruit is required to reach the maximum 500 health capacity. Once this is reached, the player's health cannot be increased beyond 500, with the exception of the [[Lifeforce]] buff.

