The '''Life Crystal''' is a [[Consumables#Permanent boosters|permanent booster]] item that permanently increases the player's [[health]] capacity by 20, adding a red heart to the player's health bar, while also restoring 20{{nbsp}}health. 

Life Crystals can be found naturally placed in any area in the [[Underground]] layer and below, though they are fairly uncommon. They cannot be found in [[the Underworld]] or the [[Dungeon]]. Life Crystals also have a {{chance|1/8}} chance to drop from a [[Golden Crate]], or {{chance|19/160}} chance from a [[Titanium Crate]].

Up to 15 Life Crystals can be used per player, increasing health capacity by 300 health (15{{nbsp}}hearts). Added to the 100{{nbsp}}health (5{{nbsp}}hearts) new players begin with, a total of 400{{nbsp}}health (20{{nbsp}}hearts) can be achieved. Additional Life Crystals can no longer be used at that point, and attempting to do so will not consume the item.

After a world converts to [[Hardmode]], and after the 400{{nbsp}}health maximum is reached from consuming Life Crystals, [[Life Fruit]]s can then be used to increase health capacity further, to a maximum of 500 health (20{{nbsp}}Life Fruits).

