'''Chlorophyte Ore''' is a [[Hardmode]] [[ore]]. After Hardmode starts, [[Mud Block]]s located near [[Jungle grass]] blocks (naturally in the [[Underground Jungle]]) in or below the bottom half of the [[Underground]] layer will occasionally be replaced by Chlorophyte Ore. It requires at least a [[Pickaxe Axe]] or [[Drax]] to be mined, whose materials require defeating all three [[mechanical bosses]].

Chlorophyte Ore is also renewable; it will slowly spread itself by converting adjacent Mud and Jungle grass blocks into more Chlorophyte Ore. It can also convert nearby [[Dirt Block]]s to Mud, convert blocks of [[Corrupt grass|Corrupt]], [[Crimson grass|Crimson]], [[Hallowed grass|Hallowed]], and regular [[grass]] to Jungle grass, as well as convert infected tiles back to its [[Jungle]] variant. Chlorophyte Ore can only spread and convert blocks if it is in or below the bottom half of the [[Underground]] layer. It can only spread itself to directly adjacent tiles (and only if there is not [[#Limit|too much]] Chlorophyte nearby already) and can only convert tiles up to 6 tiles away.

''See [[#Mechanics|Mechanics]] section for details about generation and spread of Chlorophyte Ore, and the difference of mechanics of Chlorophyte Ore in [[special world seeds]].''

== Crafting ==
