== Mechanics ==
Chlorophyte Ore have the following features at underground:{{source code ref|v=1.4.5.8|name=hardUpdateWorld|method=Terraria.WorldGen.hardUpdateWorld}}
* It can generate on [[Mud Block]]s located near [[Jungle grass]].
* It can spread to nearby Mud and Jungle grass tiles.
* It can convert infected tiles back to their [[Jungle]] or pure version, effectively protecting the Jungle from [[biome spread]].

Chlorophyte Ores can only generate, spread, and convert other tiles in [[Hardmode]]. If the [[Remix]] and [[For the Worthy]] seeds are active and the [[Celebration Mk 10]] seed is inactive, it can also generate and spread in pre-Hardmode.{{source code ref|v=1.4.5.8|field=Terraria.WorldGen.hardModeWorldUpdates}}

=== Generation and spreading ===
Chlorophyte Ore's generation and spreading attempt is triggered when the random tile update selects a [[Jungle grass]], Chlorophyte Ore, or [[Chlorophyte Brick]] tile that meets the following conditions:<ref name="hardUpdateWorld"/>
* It is not [[actuated]].
* It is lower than halfway between the border of [[surface]] and [[cavern]]{{footnote|name=halfunderground|i.e. in the bottom half of the [[Underground]] layer or below}}, ''or'' the [[Remix]] seed is active.

If all conditions are met, a random tile near the selected tile has a chance to be converted to a Chlorophyte Ore, with additional restrictions:
{{options/set|itemlist|width=17.5em}}{{options/set|item|type=tile|icons=no}}
