=== Conversion ===
Chlorophyte Ores and Chlorophyte Bricks can also convert nearby tiles to its [[Jungle]] variant. There are two types of conversion:
* Active conversion: triggered when the random tile update selects a Chlorophyte Ore or Chlorophyte Brick.<ref name="hardUpdateWorld"/><!--conversionType == 9-->
* Defensive conversion: only happens when [[Remix]] is active; triggered when the random tile update causes a [[Corruption]] or [[Crimson]] tile selects a tile with Chlorophyte Ore or Chlorophyte Brick nearby to [[spread]] to.{{source code ref|v=1.4.5.8|method=Terraria.WorldGen.ChlorophyteDefense}}<!--conversionType == 10-->

An active conversion requires the selected Chlorophyte Ore or Chlorophyte Brick meet the following conditions (same conditions as generation):
* It is not [[actuated]].
* It is lower than halfway between the border of [[surface]] and [[cavern]]{{footnote|name=halfunderground}}, ''or'' the [[Remix]] seed is active.

A defensive conversion is not guaranteed, its chance is determined by the total count of Chlorophyte Ores and Chlorophyte Bricks within a 11×11-tile square area centered on the selected tile:{{source code ref|v=1.4.5.8|method=Terraria.WorldGen.nearbyChlorophyte}}
