'''Hellstone''' is a [[pre-Hardmode]] [[ore]] that can be found in [[The Underworld]]. Mining it requires at least a [[Nightmare Pickaxe|Nightmare]]/[[Deathbringer Pickaxe]], and it cannot be mined with [[Explosives (class)|explosives]] in [[pre-Hardmode]]. Hellstone releases a half-tile of [[lava]] when mined in The Underworld.

Hellstone inflicts the [[Burning]] [[debuff]] on players who touch it, which can be negated through items such as the [[Obsidian Skull]] and [[Obsidian Skin Potion]].

