== Notes ==
* The [[Spelunker]] buff will not highlight Hellstone, and the [[Metal Detector]] (and upgrades) will also not detect Hellstone nearby. However, it will be shown by the [[Dangersense]] buff.
* [[NPCs]], [[enemies]], and [[critters]] do not receive damage from Hellstone.
* Hellstone cannot be swapped for other blocks via [[Block Swap]].

== Achievements ==
{{achievement|name=Ooo! Shiny!}}

== Tips ==
* Crafting Hellstone and [[Obsidian]] into [[Hellstone Bar]]s and selling the bars is {{percent|{{sell expr|raw=y|Hellstone Bar|/(|Hellstone|*3 <!-- 3 Hellstone and 1 Obsidian make 1 Hellstone Bar, and Obsidian has no sell value-->)}} -1 round 2}} more profitable than selling an equivalent amount of raw ingredients.
* Lava can be farmed by repeatedly mining and placing Hellstone in The Underworld.
* Placing gravity-affected [[blocks]] such as [[Sand Block]]s on top of Hellstone will prevent the Hellstone from inflicting damage.

== Trivia ==
* Hellstone, [[Meteorite]], and [[Luminite]] are the only ores that do not have "ore" in their names.
* Hellstone is the only ore of which its bar requires another material (Obsidian) in addition to the ore to smelt.
* Hellstone is programmed to have a special immunity to being destroyed in lava, despite its rarity of {{iteminfo|Hellstone|rare}} already preventing it from being destroyed in lava.{{source code ref|v=1.4.4.9|method=Terraria.Item.CheckLavaDeath|field=Terraria.ID.ItemID&#46;Sets.IsLavaImmuneRegardlessOfRarity}}
** This is because before [[1.1]], it had a rarity of {{rare|0|cate=n}}, meaning it would have otherwise been able to be destroyed by lava. When its rarity was increased, the special immunity to lava was not removed.

