'''Luminite''' is a [[Hardmode]] [[ore]] dropped by the [[Moon Lord]] in stacks of 70–90 ({{expert|90–110}}). It does not naturally generate in the world, and can be mined using any [[pickaxe]].

Crafting all items (excluding ammunition, dye, and bricks) requires a total of 362 Luminite Bars and 25 Luminite (1,473 Luminite; requires defeating the Moon Lord 17–22 / {{expert|14–17}} times). Crafting all items pertaining to one type of [[Lunar Fragments|Lunar Fragment]] (i.e., armor, wings, pickaxe/drill, and hamaxe) requires 68 Luminite Bars (272 Luminite) in addition to 85 of the Lunar Fragment; this requires defeating the Moon Lord only 4 / {{expert|3–4}} times.

