== Trivia ==
* Luminite differs from other ores in numerous ways:
** It is only dropped by a boss.
** It is not crafted into bars at a [[Furnace]], [[Hellforge]], or [[Hardmode Forges|Hardmode Forge]].
** It cannot be detected by the [[Spelunker Potion]], [[Magic Lantern]], [[Metal Detector]], or [[Suspicious Looking Tentacle]].
** It does not grant the [[Ooo! Shiny!]] achievement.
** It does not have a specific associated set of armor, weapons, or tools, instead requiring [[Lunar Fragments]] in order to craft gear.
** It can be mined with any pickaxe or equivalent tool.
* Luminite is referred to as <code>LunarOre</code> in the game's source code.

