'''Titanium Ore''' belongs to the third tier of the early [[Hardmode]] [[ores]]. Upon the third [[altar]] broken, either it or [[Adamantite Ore]] can spawn in the [[cavern]] layer, roughly at [[lava]] depth. Mining Titanium Ore requires a [[Mythril Pickaxe|Mythril]]/[[Orichalcum Pickaxe]] or better.

As with all early Hardmode ores, decreasing quantities of the ore spawn with every third altar broken afterwards, it is immune to [[Explosives (class)|explosives]] (apart from the [[Power Bomb]] and [[Sticky Power Bomb]]), and it can be obtained from Hardmode [[crates]].

It is one of the two ores able to create [[Hardmode Forges]], which are used for smelting all ores obtained in future progression, as well as itself.

