* {{wikipedia|Titanium}} is a real metal. Its legendary reputation for durability is based on its high strength-to-weight ratio and corrosion resistance.
** [[Palladium Ore|Palladium]], [[Cobalt Ore|Cobalt]], and Titanium are the only Hardmode ores named after real metals.
* Real-life titanium is silvery white in color, while Titanium Ore in ''Terraria'' also sheens with purple.
** It also makes up a pigment known as titanium dioxide, which is referenced by the [[Painter]]'s quote "{{gameText|LegacyDialog.253}}".
** Oddly, Titanium Ore is used to craft [[Green Brick]]s. This is likely because it would be the only missing Hardmode ore to craft a Dungeon Brick otherwise.

