'''Wood''' is a type of [[block]] that is generally obtained by cutting down [[trees]] using an [[axe]] or a [[chainsaw]]. Regular Wood can be harvested from [[Forest tree]]s, [[vanity tree]]s, [[Living Tree]]s, and [[Underground Cabin]]s in [[underground]] or [[cavern]] layers, as well as by using the [[Faecorn]]. Forest trees can be cultivated by placing [[Acorn]]s on top of regular [[grass]] or [[Mowed grass]] above [[surface]], and vanity trees can be cultivated by placing [[Sakura Sapling]] or [[Yellow Willow Sapling]] on top of any grass (but yields [[Ebonwood]] or [[Shadewood]] instead if placed on [[Corrupt]] or [[Crimson]] grass variants).

Apart from regular Wood, there are 11 other types of wood. [[Crafting]] recipes that include [[Any Wood]] as an ingredient can use any type except [[Dynasty Wood]], [[Feywood]], and [[Pine Wood]].

