Each type of Wood has a respective:
* [[Sword]], [[bow]], and [[hammer]] (except Spooky, Dynasty, Fey, and Pine)
* Armor set (except Dynasty, Fey, and Pine)
* Furniture set

{{item|Pine Tree Block|icons=no}}, while only loosely defined as a Wood, can be used to craft some wooden furniture (specifically pine wood). It however cannot be used for recipes that require Any Wood.

[[Cactus]], [[Pumpkin]], [[Bamboo]], and [[Glowing Mushroom]] display some Wood-like properties, especially in the sense that they are gathered from background plants cut with an axe (or pickaxe in the case of Bamboo). Cactus, Pumpkin, Bamboo, and Glowing Mushroom cannot be used in recipes calling for Any Wood, however they do have recipes for furniture, tools, and weapons much like those of regular Wood. Gem trees, while having tree-like properties, drop stone and their respective gem.

Some Wood types are found placed in other forms. For example, [[Underground Cabin]]s generally use Wood corresponding to their [[biome]] (i.e. Rich Mahogany in the Jungle, Boreal in the Snow biome, regular Wood basically everywhere else). [[Living Tree]]s and [[Living Mahogany Tree]]s are made of Living Wood and Rich Mahogany, respectively.

