'''Cobwebs''' are [[crafting material]]s used to craft [[Silk]] and other items. Cobwebs can also be placed. Placed Cobwebs catch players who fall into them and reset [[fall damage]]. They break after a short time when a player is stuck in them, and they can also be harvested instantly with any [[weapon]] or swung [[tool]].

Cobwebs are commonly found in [[underground]] areas in clusters of 5 or more alongside the edges of walls or ceilings, and are guaranteed to drop a Cobweb item when broken. They are also found in large quantities in [[Spider Nest]]s, where they regrow over time; however, Cobwebs found there only have a {{chance|1/4}} chance to drop when broken.

In [[Expert Mode]] worlds with the [[Remix]] seed enabled, web spit attack from [[Black Recluse]]s and [[Jungle Creeper]]s can randomly place Cobwebs in a 13×13 rectangular area centered on the location where Web Spit projectiles disappear.

