== Notes ==
* When the player is stuck in Cobweb tiles and does not leave them, a single Cobweb tile is broken after a random period between {{duration|20ticks}} and {{duration|100ticks}}. Additionally, Cobwebs immediately break if the player collides with them when riding a [[minecart]].{{source code ref|v=1.4.4.9|method=Terraria.Player.StickyMovement}}
* Placed Cobwebs do not impede the movement of enemies, [[NPCs]], or [[critters]].
* Although Cobwebs have no sell value, they can be crafted into [[Silk]], which has a sell value of {{iteminfo|Silk|sell}}. At 7 Cobwebs per Silk, this results in a sell value of {{sell expr||floor(|Silk|/7<!--7 Cobweb make 1 Silk-->)}} for a Cobweb.

== Tips ==
* Because they slow player movement, Cobwebs can be used in the construction of pits to prevent [[fall damage]].
* It is more resourceful to make [[Silk Rope]] instead of [[Web Rope]], as using Silk consumes less Cobweb and yields more rope.
* An easy way to find Cobweb is to use a [[Dangersense Potion]] as it highlights the Cobweb on the screen.

