'''Gel''' is a common [[crafting material]] dropped by most [[slime]]s and [[Zombie|Slimed Zombies]]. Gel is vital due to it being an ingredient in [[Torch]]es, and is used regularly from the beginning stages all the way through to endgame scenarios. It is also used as [[ammunition]] for the [[Flamethrower]] and the [[Elf Melter]], and can therefore be stored in the player's [[ammo slot]]s.

