== Notes ==
{{float file box|[[File:Gel colors.png]]|Some different colors of Gel.}}
* Though the tooltip says 'tasty and flammable', Gel cannot be eaten. The only edible item it is used in is the [[Lesser Healing Potion]].
* By default, Gel is blue-colored, but different types of slimes can drop Gel with different colors (e.g. Gels dropped by [[Green Slime]]s are green).
** The color of Gel in the player's [[inventory]] depends on what color Gel was first looted in a particular stack by that player.
** If two differently colored stacks of Gel are combined, the new stack takes on the color of the stack put onto the other, no matter the stack size.
** Gel will always appear as blue on [[Item Frame]]s.
** The [[Quick Stack to Nearby Chests]] animation always shows blue Gel.
** Gel color will return to blue if the player drops it or places it on an Item Frame and picks it back up or exits a world and rejoins.
** The colors of Gel dropped by different types of slimes are shown below.{{source code ref|v=1.4.4.9|method=Terraria.GameContent.ItemDropRules.CommonCode.ModifyItemDropFromNPC}}<!--
