The '''Vortex Fragment''' is a [[Hardmode]], post-[[Lunatic Cultist]] [[crafting material]]. It is one of the four [[Lunar Fragments]], dropped from the [[Vortex Pillar]] during the [[Lunar Events]] in stacks of 12–60 / {{expert|24–100}}. Vortex Fragments can be used to craft [[Vortex armor]], an end-game armor set that benefits all types of [[ranged weapons]], as well as Vortex-themed [[tools]], [[weapons]], [[wings]], etc.

Crafting all items requires 121 Vortex Fragments and 68 [[Luminite Bar]]s (272 [[Luminite]]), which necessitates defeating the Vortex Pillar at least 3–11 / {{expert|2–8}} times (note that the Vortex Fragment can also be crafted from the other fragments) and fighting the [[Moon Lord]] at least 4 / {{expert|3–4}} times.

