'''Demonite Ore''' is a [[pre-Hardmode]] [[ore]]. It is primarily dropped from the [[Eater of Worlds]], as well as the [[Eye of Cthulhu]] in [[Corruption]] worlds. Demonite Ore can also be found rarely in small veins [[underground]]. When below [[Depth Meter|0 ft]] in elevation, a [[Gold Pickaxe]] or better is needed to mine it, otherwise any [[Pickaxes|pickaxe]] can be used.

It is the Corruption counterpart to [[The Crimson]]'s [[Crimtane Ore]].

