== Notes ==
* Demonite Ore emits a faint blue glow when placed, similar to Crimtane Ore's faint red glow. It also periodically release sparkles which make it glow brighter.
* Demonite Ore does ''not'' [[Biome spread|spread]] the Corruption at any time.
* Unlike its Crimson counterpart, Demonite Ore can be found in increased amounts within Corruption cave systems.
* Very rarely, Demonite Ore can spawn extremely close to the [[surface]].

