* Demonite Ore can be mined early on using [[Explosives (class)|explosives]], granting players powerful Demonite gear in the early game.
* Repeatedly killing the Eater of Worlds and selling the Demonite Ore it drops is a good way to [[Guide:Making money|make money]].

== Trivia ==
* The placed block texture of Demonite Ore resembles scales, likely alluding to [[Shadow Scale]]s, a material dropped by the Eater of Worlds.

